# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and uncomment what you need. With nothing set, the fake provider runs.

# The live provider: the tutor, and the writing and grading too unless LF_AUTHOR is set.
# LF_PROVIDER defaults to anthropic when a key is set, else fake. LF_MODEL's default is in
# packages/runtime/src/env.ts.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# LF_PROVIDER=anthropic
# LF_MODEL=

# Plan and write courses with an agent harness you are signed in to (claude-code or cursor; needs
# `claude` or `cursor-agent` on the PATH). LF_PLAN_MODEL plans and revises; LF_WRITE_MODEL writes the
# modules, which is most of the usage.
# LF_AUTHOR=claude-code
# LF_PLAN_MODEL=opus
# LF_WRITE_MODEL=sonnet

# Where topics live. Default: bank/ at the repo root.
# BANK_DIR=
